<title>FINLAND: Yeltsin arrives in Helsinki for summit.</title>
<headline>Yeltsin arrives in Helsinki for summit.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian President Boris Yeltsin arrived in the Finnish capital for a summit with U.S. President Bill Clinton on Thursday.</p>
<p>Yeltsin's plane touched down at Helsinki's Vantaa airport at 1250 GMT. The summit starts with a dinner later on Thursday and the main talks are on Friday.</p>
</text>
